late installed, the editor freezes indefinitely. I have to force-quit the application in order to get it to close.\n\nUsing a debugger, I was able to gather that it was getting stuck on the method `EditorExportPlatformAndroid::_stop_check_for_changes_poll_thread()` run in the destructor for `EditorExportPlatformAndroid`, where it runs `check_for_changes_thread.wait_to_finish()`. This call seems to just get stuck indefinitely.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI have been able to get the freeze to trigger when opening the project and immediately closing it, then pressing \"Don't Save\".\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI don't currently have an MRP, unfortunately. I will see if I can put one together soon, but even with my main project where the problem has been appearing a lot, it still doesn't _always_ happen.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119324/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}